Call me partial to Moorcock, but I think that Stormbringer should really
kick much more butt than it presently does.  Granted, Thor's hammer should
be a serious electric nail pounder, but Stormbringer should really suck lots
of souls, maybe even of its own volition, and perhaps simply attacking with 
it should instantly convert a player to Chaos if they aren't there already.
And the fact that Cleaver is a more powerful weapon is silly.  Stormbringer 
should really do some mondo damage.

With the number of artifacts a lawful character can get from a deity in
a good mood, it would seem that other alignments should have more selection.
By the way, I found Mjollnir in a shop for the bargain basement price of 
6526gp, what a deal!

I have to ask if some of the "game-balance" features are not simply random
deaths.  I don't have any particular incidents I want to gripe about, but
