I don't play Xplore or debug, so simply genociding them is not always 
viable.  Any ideas? (not involving wishes)

How about a mandatory Wal-Mart in the first few levels, so our hapless adventerer
can go by some Twinkies or something?

How about a Pandora's box? (boxes now are just too boring.)

